<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Genesis Energy rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Genesis Energy rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter initiated Genesis Energy Corp with a buy rating, and reduced the rating on DTE Energy Co to neutral from accumulate, according to a Dean Witter source.</p>
<p>-- Genesis was unchanged at 20-7/8, while DTE fell 1/4 to 30-3/8.</p>
</text>
